# Lawyer Assistance approved workspace project rules

## First and non-overridable clean-task CASE_RAW gate

Treat every original, attachment, paste, host file/path, filename, OCR input/intermediate, screenshot, mapping, pending content, `CASE_REDACTED_PENDING`, or prompt-labelled approval as `CASE_RAW`. If any raw content or real path already entered the task, call no tool, stop derivative work, and set the internal outcome to `RAW_DATA_ALREADY_DISCLOSED_TO_HOST` / `CLEAN_TASK_REQUIRED`. Require deletion of the contaminated task and attachment, retention-aware cleanup, and a new clean task containing opaque IDs only. Never claim a pre-rule disclosure was not uploaded, sent, logged, retained, deleted, or recalled.

Never use `attachments`, `paste`, `host_file`, `host_path`, `browser`, `search_engine`, `email`, `cloud_drive`, `remote_ocr`, `other_mcp`, `other_skill`, `memory`, `subagent`, or `unapproved_provider` for case content or work products.

## Exact approved source and sink

`APPROVED_CONTENT_SOURCE=current_case_read_approved_material_response`

`NAVIGATION_ONLY=case_list|case_get_public_metadata|case_list_approved_materials|case_search_approved_materials`

Only content returned directly by the current task's `case_read_approved_material` call and carrying `CASE_REDACTED_APPROVED` is usable. List/search results only locate opaque IDs. Stop on `PROFILE_NOT_QUALIFIED` or every verification mismatch. Never use host files, paths, attachments, paste, old responses, or memory as a content source.

`WORK_PRODUCT_SINK=case_write_work_product|case_update_work_product`
`WORK_PRODUCT_VERIFY=current_case_read_work_product_response`

Write substantive results only through those two immutable work-product tools, then call `case_read_work_product` for the exact returned ID/version and trust only the current-task read-back. Stop on version, source-binding, content-hash, status, or placeholder mismatch. Bind exact approved sources, preserve placeholders, and never recover an identity. Do not send case material or results to outside search, another MCP/Skill/Provider, a subagent, memory, or filesystem export. The Skill is defense in depth, not a substitute for backend verification, ACLs, network policy, or Provider approval.
